en:
Li Bai (Tang Dynasty)
On Phoenix Terrace, phoenixes once made their flight;
The birds have gone, the terrace stands bare, the river flows in the light.
Wu's palace flowers are buried beneath overgrown ways;
Jin's noble robes and caps are turned to mounds of old days.
Three peaks half-fade beyond the azure skies so wide;
Two streams cut through where the Egret Shoals divide.
Floating clouds forever veil the glorious sun;
Chang'an is lost from sight, leaving my grief begun.

To find these items, you must be observant:

Follow the green lanterns as they mark the routes set by the gatekeeper for the living;
If you meet a masked lantern bearer, you may seek assistance from them.

Besides conventional status and merit ranking, Masked Troupe also aggregates merits earned by all disciples on the leaderboard into the #Ytotal troupe popularity#E, which will determine troupe level promotions. 
Total troupe popularity of #Y0~9999#E: #YCatching Melody#E; 
Total troupe popularity of #Y>10,000#E: #YElegant Ensemble#E; 
Total troupe popularity of #Y>50,000#E: #YMelody Harmony#E; 
Total troupe popularity of #Y>200,000#E: #YHeavenly Song#E.
